# Build System

## Standard workflow

Use CMake presets — do not invent custom configure flags unless asked:

```bash
cmake --preset debug
cmake --build --preset debug
ctest --preset debug
```

Presets: `debug`, `release` (see `CMakePresets.json`).

## vcpkg

- Manifest mode via `vcpkg.json` — submodule at `externals/vcpkg/`
- Setup logic: `cmake/VcpkgSetup.cmake` (auto-fetches and bootstraps if needed)
- **Never edit** ports or files inside `externals/vcpkg/`
- Custom triplet: `-DHVT_BASE_TRIPLET_FILE=...` (see `docs/vcpkg.md`)
- Faster release builds: `-DHVT_RELEASE_ONLY_VCPKG_DEPS=ON`

## OpenUSD

- Default: vcpkg `usd-minimal` feature when `OPENUSD_INSTALL_PATH` is unset
- Local USD: `export OPENUSD_INSTALL_PATH=/path/to/usd/install` before `cmake --preset debug`

## User overrides

`CMakeUserPresets.json` is gitignored — use for local custom presets, not committed changes.

## Generated files

`include/hvt/namespace.h` is generated at configure time — do not hand-edit.
